From 1e5dcc96d2870d15a543f091874a1de8d8f78832 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: minamorl <minamorl@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 17 Jul 2026 21:21:35 +0900
Subject: [PATCH 02/15] Merge gpx1000's transform-feedback support (15a8b709)
 into the GS branch

TF introduces vertex_shader_is_kernel() (vertex runs as compute when capturing SO);
merged with the GS branch's for_mesh_pipeline conditions: mesh object functions are
not kernels, so is_kernel() sites keep their !for_mesh_pipeline / || for_mesh_pipeline
adjustments. xfb_{counter,output}_buffer_index_base join draw_info_index in the MSL
options; analyze_xfb_buffers() is called from compile() after
fixup_image_load_store_access(); capture_output_to_buffer now ORs in
needs_transform_feedback().
